Package: poscosea
Title: A Computationally Efficient Sensitivity Analysis for MCMC Output
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person(
      "Yusaku",
      "Ohkubo",
      email = "ohkubo.yusaku1989@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: 
    Bootstrap and leave-k-out cross-validation
    using infinitesimal jackknife approximations
    from MCMC samples. For binomial N-mixture models,
    site- and visit-level log-likelihoods and a two-stage
    (site and visit) bootstrap approximation are provided.
